# HTML reporting guidelines

Plan-anchor HTML reports follow this page; `scripts/change_report.py` renders:

- `change` (`references/change-report.md`): `change_report.py --anchors --baseline-rev ...`
- `trace` (`references/record-trace.md`): `change_report.py --trace <trace.json>`
- `cleanup` (`references/record-cleanup.md`): `change_report.py --trace <trace.json> --proposals <proposals.json>`

## Where a report goes

`change_report.py` writes to `reports_dir` (`.sc/plan-anchor/settings.yaml`, relative to `.sc/`'s parent; default `site/reports/plan-anchor`), set by `python3 "<this skill's directory>/scripts/plan_anchor_settings.py" set reports_dir <folder>`; commit settings. `--out` only for owner-named folders.

## Sources saved beside it

`change_report.py` copies rebuild sources (`data.sources`) to `<reports_dir>/<name>/sources/`:

- change: `anchors.json` (now and baseline), run files read, drift review, fixture checks, tuning results;
- trace, cleanup: trace JSON (Raptor-served records, merged annotations), proposals (owner approvals).

Commit page, `<name>/` and sidecar together.

## Names

`YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS-<kind>-<subject>` (UTC generation time, kind, plan folder name), deduplicated by `-2`, `-3`, ... `change_report.py` default; `--name` only to rebuild under its existing name.

## Index

Then add `data.index_entry` (one `<li>` linking the page) as the first item of `<reports_dir>/index.html`'s list (create if missing), newest first; touch no others. A deploy-built stamped-name index replaces this; never edit a generated index.

## Shared report language

- **Header**: title, who-computed-what subtitle, `Generated: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM UTC`.
- Jev's numbers: `Jev P(yes)`; script-computed classes/verdicts: "computed by jev_judge.py from Jev's P(yes)"; no Jev prose.
- Beside agent text: "written by the anchor-cleanup-proposer agent, not Jev" (or that agent's name).
- Owner verbatim: "Owner said: “...”"; proposal reply: "Owner reply"; panel decision: "Owner decision".
- **Buttons**: `{}` "Copy JSON": panel data; ⎘ "Copy Context": panel as plain text.
- **Reply line**: "Reply e.g.: approve 1-5, reject 6, change 7 to: <text>".
- **Legend**: trace cells coloured `serves`, `related`, `exceeds`, `conflicts`, `none`; change status `PASS`, `DRIFT`, `FAIL`.
- **Footer**: "Generated by plan-anchoring change_report.py", then sidecar, sources locations.

Every report workflow sends the owner path/link and sources location.
